   ("implication in predicate argument",
    ``MEM (MEM h t ==> MEM h t) [T]``),
   ("negation in predicate argument", ``MEM (~MEM h t) [T]``),
   ("lambda in predicate argument", ``MEM ((\x : num. x) h) t``),
   ("lambda as a function value", ``MEM (\x : num. x) [I]``)]

